            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Faraho yaagira ati: Niinyija kubareka mugyende, mutambire MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ebitambo omu ihamba; kwonka mutaza hare munonga; kandi munyeshengyerereze MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaagira ati: Reeba naaza kuruga omu maisho gaawe, nze kweshengyereza MUKAMA, emizinga y'eshohera erugye ahari Faraho n'abaheereza be n'aha bantu be nyencakare; kwonka Faraho atagaruka kugobya obundi, okutareka bantu kuza kutambira MUKAMA ebitambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaaruga omu maisho ga Faraho, yaayeshengyereza MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaakora nk'oku Musa yaagamba, yaiha emizinga y'eshohera ahari Faraho n'aha baheereza be n'aha bantu be; tihaatsigaraho shohera n'emwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
